// Accumulate into one retained string: 2000 concats, then measure it. The min
// seed grows the builder in place; a backend that copied every step would be
// O(N^2) here. Same values on every backend.
// The last index is bound to a name first: gen2 refuses a call such as len()
// INSIDE an index expression (docs/STATUS.md), so the portable spelling is
// hold n = len(s) - 1 / show s[n].
hold s = "abc"
hold i = 0
while i < 2000 {
  hold s = concat(s, "x")
  hold i = i + 1
}
show len(s)
show s[0]
hold n = len(s) - 1
show s[n]
